00:39:01.730 --> 00:39:21.570
But then you get older and I think going from hat to hat, like living a hat to hat lifestyle like in your 40s and 50s gets really, like if you haven't made some real decisions and put down some roots and made some real, you know, depth-centered decisions and forge relationships that can get a little sadder.
